<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-πράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring about, achieve,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				582
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόδ᾽ ἐξέπραξεν ὥστε..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					723
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρέος</span>
			<i>perform</i> a service, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				472
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					303
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόλιον εὐνὴν ἐξέπραξ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν καλλίνικον..ἐξεπράξατε ἐς
				γόον</span> ye <i>have made</i> the hymn of triumph
				<i>end in</i> wailing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1161
			</span></i> ; in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					6.118
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make an end of, kill, destroy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1275
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1659
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				515
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>exact, levy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος δίκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδίκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					554.19
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thermon</span>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				672.39
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) : c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα ἐ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.108
				</span></i>
			 : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ταμίας ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					774e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.79
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made to pay,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα ὑπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					7.12.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>exact punishment for</i> a thing, <i>avenge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				377
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρῷον φόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					1305
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Δωριέος πρὸς Ἐγεσταίων φόνον
					ἐκπρήξασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.158
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
